The file curves.json derives from D2Foundry's Oracle Engine at commit
dcd0c7d302b056ffbb532edcb711d724a17ca8c1 of
https://github.com/d2foundry/oracle_engine. The curves and the weapon
lists come from build_resources/weapon_formulas.json. The frame lists come
from build_resources/cached_build.ron and build.rs. The aim-down-sights
falloff scales come from src/weapons/stat_calc.rs, and curves.go ports the
math of that file to Go.

